-- expect-refusal: expected a term, got ')'
-- examples/checks/agg-shrug-wfs-nullary-term-refused.rofl — agg_cell_shrug_wfs:
-- `p()` is a nullary literal and never a term. Read as a compound of no
-- arguments, `not unknown(sw_n1())` asked of a term no atom is, and held
-- beside the paradox sw_n1; the TypeScript parser refused it.
semantics(well_founded).
sw_n_wrong() :- not unknown(sw_n1()).
